{"parse":{"title":"Dirge of the Fandyr","pageid":491561,"revid":2189647,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Dirge of the Fandyr</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/3e/Talent_Dirge_of_the_Fandyr.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928030616\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Dirge of the Fandyr\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/3e/Talent_Dirge_of_the_Fandyr.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928030616\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/3e/Talent_Dirge_of_the_Fandyr.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928030616 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/3e/Talent_Dirge_of_the_Fandyr.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928030616 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Dirge of the Fandyr\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Dirge_of_the_Fandyr.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Dirge of the Fandyr.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vodyanitsa\" title=\"Vodyanitsa\">Vodyanitsa</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When the Elemental Skill Rechitativ: Sonorous Dawn is used, Vodyanitsa will also gain 25 stacks of <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Lead Vocal</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Lead Vocal</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">When the party's currently active character deals <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro DMG</b></span> or <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo DMG</b></span> with a Normal Attack, Charged Attack, Plunging Attack, Elemental Skill, or Elemental Burst, 1 stack of \"Lead Vocal\" is consumed. This in turn increases the DMG dealt. However, if a Wandering Vortex is present on the field or during the 5s following a Wandering Vortex explosion, this effect will only trigger when the character deals Stellar Swirl reaction DMG.<br />Every 1000 Max HP Vodyanitsa has in excess of 40000 will increase the Stellar Swirl reaction DMG from the above effect by 260, as well as <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro DMG</b></span> and <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo DMG</b></span> dealt by 140. Stellar Swirl reaction DMG dealt can be increased by a maximum of 6500 while <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro DMG</b></span> and <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo DMG</b></span> can be increased by a maximum of 3500 in this way.</span></span></span> as well as 10 stacks of <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Chorus</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Chorus</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Triggered by off-field party members or other nearby party members (and not your currently active party member). Effects are the same as those of \"Lead Vocal.\"</span></span></span>.<br />The two effects above last 30s each, and the stack count is refreshed when the Elemental Skill is used.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Dirge of the Fandyr</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Vodyanitsa\" title=\"Vodyanitsa\">Vodyanitsa</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Etymology\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Etymology</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDirge_of_the_Fandyr%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDirge_of_the_Fandyr%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panduri\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Panduri\">Panduri</a> (<span><u>Georgian</u>: <span lang=\"ka\">ფანდური</span> <i>panduri</i></span>; <span><u>Ossetian</u>: <span lang=\"os\">фӕндыр</span> <i>fændyr</i></span>) is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Georgia_(country)#Folk_music\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Music of Georgia (country)\">traditional Georgian</a> three-string plucked instrument common in all regions of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eastern_Georgia_(country)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Eastern Georgia (country)\">Eastern Georgia</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDirge_of_the_Fandyr%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Dirge of the Fandyr</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">十二弦的泪歌</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Shí'èrxián de Lèigē</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Weeping Song of the Twelve Strings</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">十二弦的淚歌</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Shí'èrxián de Lèigē</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">十二弦の涙唄</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">열두</span> <span lang=\"ko\">현의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">애가</span><br /><small><i>Yeoldu Hyeonui Aega</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Endecha del fandyr</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Chant fun<span lang=\"fr\">è</span>bre du fandyr</td><td>Dirge of the Fandyr</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Скорбная</span> <span lang=\"ru\">песнь</span> <span lang=\"ru\">фандыра</span><br /><small><i>Skorbnaya pesn' fandyra</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Dirge of the Fandyr</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Bi Ca Mười Hai Dây</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Trauerlied des Fandyr</td><td>Dirge of the Fandyr</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Dirge of the Fandyr</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>L<span lang=\"pt\">á</span>grimas das Doze Cordas</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Fandyr A<span lang=\"tr\">ğı</span>d<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Marcia funebre del Fandyr</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-a